{"change_summary":"No additional source edits were required in this apply-fixes pass. The approved explicit carbonate-equilibrium implementation and follow-up remediation were already present in the worktree, so this stage verified the integrated state rather than patching code again.","outstanding_risks":["`solve_carbonate_equilibrium()` still uses a freshwater-focused approximation with fixed `Ka2`, so any future extension beyond the intended pH 5.5-8.5 aquarium envelope should revisit the chemistry model.","Legacy saves with custom out-of-range source-water catalog entries still deserialize, but runtime water-change actions against those profiles now fail validation until the profile is corrected.","The unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory remains in the worktree and was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Review the prior implementation/review outputs and inspect the current workspace for unresolved carbonate follow-up items.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply any remaining carbonate-solver fixes; skipped because the current worktree already contained the approved implementation and no new actionable review amendments remained.","order":1,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Re-run regression and quality checks to confirm the approved carbonate/state-contract implementation remains green in the current workspace.","order":2,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git status --short` showed no tracked source deltas; only the unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory is present.","`cargo fmt --all --check` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios` passed, including chemistry, save/load, shrimp, substrate/filter, source-water validation, and scenario materialization coverage.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.","A codebase scan confirmed the current workspace still routes save normalization, source-water validation, and gameplay carbonate refreshes through `normalize_loaded_carbonate_state()`, `validate_source_water_carbonate_profile()`, and `resolve_carbonate_state()`." ]}